Package: box-desktop-app
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: zoomriya-setup, zoomriya-agent, zoomriya-id, sway, python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
 fonts-inter, adwaita-icon-theme, libpam-systemd, pipewire, pipewire-bin, wireplumber, systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Box Desktop, on the ZOOMRIYA Box's own screen
 The admins' desktop, shown on the box's screen once it's set up. An admin
 signs in with the box's ZOOMRIYA ID; the desktop asks zoomriya-agent for
 everything it shows or changes, and plays and records sound through
 PipeWire.
